{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"\"What talk about?\"","created_at":"2020-08-11T21:11:58.569000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742852839893631028","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"“I know there’s a lot of secrets the Masons have. More than the Knights. I just... I want to know more about the Masons. Your goals.”","created_at":"2020-08-11T21:16:02.935000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742853864838922370","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"Web nods. \"Don't know everything. Not lots of notes left by Daysong. Know we want knowledge, want understand things. Know we want reunite old and new world. Know we want stop hunger.\"","created_at":"2020-08-11T21:18:24.207000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742854457376768273","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"They shake their head at the last bit. “But how do you want to stop it. By leaving it be? Or by killing it.”","created_at":"2020-08-11T21:20:25.305000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742854965298462760","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"\"Not leave it be. Know old tinkers banished it instead of kill it.\" They heft the chisel. \"It gives me visions in dreams. Saw old old fight against hunger. Don't know if didn't kill it because didn't want to or because couldn't. Web wants to end it. End it for good.\"","created_at":"2020-08-11T21:25:30.886000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742856246998335488","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"\"What knights have to do with this. Know first knight was mason, know knights also seek hunger's end.\"","created_at":"2020-08-11T21:26:14.185000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742856428607504405","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"Web looks at Wynne, concerned. They speak softly: \"Florian think masons not want kill the hunger?\" Web looks worried.","created_at":"2020-08-11T21:27:07.058000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-11T21:27:15.932000Z","id":"742856650372677794","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"They nod slowly. “We had discovered some things... that indicated the Masons wanted to contain it, study it... and let the old world be consumed.”","created_at":"2020-08-11T21:30:03.440000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742857390172405780","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"Web nods slowly. \"Sad to hear. If could be contained and studied would be interesting, but are much past that point. If can kill it, much still to be learned from its corpse. Perhaps more.\"","created_at":"2020-08-11T21:31:57.348000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742857867937185933","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"\"What find that indicated this?\"","created_at":"2020-08-11T21:32:09.127000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742857917342023691","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"“Certain markings, made with Masonic tools. Like your chisel. They were made in the name of the Hunger, not against it.”","created_at":"2020-08-11T21:33:03.668000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742858146103689308","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"At this Web looks more concerned. \"Golden Dawn used to be like masons. Could be them.\"","created_at":"2020-08-11T21:34:03.076000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742858395278770286","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"\"Florian let Web see these? Chisel could help provide answer.\"","created_at":"2020-08-11T21:34:38.711000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742858544742793247","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"“Maybe. I can ask him, definitely.” They let out a deep breath. “The Knights were formed because the Masons didn’t kill the Hunger the first time around. They let it live, rejuvenate, and become stronger than before. That’s the other reason trust is fraying, I think. Too many things point to the Masons supporting, not destroying, the Hunger.”","created_at":"2020-08-11T21:37:01.479000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742859143555186789","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
